randomized survival probability of Li, Wu and Feng (2021), \code{qnorm(u)} with
\code{u = S(t)} at an event and \code{u ~ U(0, S(c))} at a censoring.

Measured on simulated data (plug-in, with the PEV of the latent effect as the
only departure from the true parameters; 1000 data sets per cell,
\verb{validation/residual_diagnostics_calibration.R plugin}): the Kolmogorov-Smirnov test
